arbeitnow:senior-finance-systems-develop:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The Company You’ll Join&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Carta is the connected platform and AI-native ecosystem for private capital. Built to replace fragmented tools with a single system of record, Carta brings together the software, services, and legal infrastructure that founders use to manage equity, fund managers use to run administration and reporting, and legal teams use to close transactions. Trusted by 55,000 companies and 1.8M+ equity holders in 160+ countries, and 10,000 funds and SPVs representing $250B+ in assets under management, Carta is transforming how private capital operates. Recognized by Fortune, Forbes, Fast Company, Inc. and Great Places to Work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information about our offices and culture, check out our &lt;a href="https://carta.com/careers/"&gt;Carta careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team You’ll Work With&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Finance Systems Administrator role will report to and work closely with the Finance Systems Senior Manager as well as partner with stakeholders across the Company in finance, accounting engineering, and business systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Problems You’ll Solve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Carta, we're transforming how private capital operates — connecting the software, services, and legal infrastructure that founders, fund managers, and legal teams depend on. We believe the problems we solve today unlock the opportunities of tomorrow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Finance Systems Developer role will proactively support the AI-driven development, implementation, and maintenance of Carta’s enterprise finance systems with a primary focus on NetSuite, Zuora, and related peripheral systems. This role will demonstrate strong influence and communications skills to collaborate internally with Finance, AP, AR and IT teams. The position will act as an advisor to the organization on system efficiency and effectiveness. The position will be the primary internal system admin and support contact for all finance systems in the Europe region including NetSuite, Zuora, Stripe, Zip, and others . This role will also collaborate with US counterparts to support the Middle East and APAC regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Other responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the adoption of AI, automation, and emerging technologies to transform accounting processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Estimate, design, implement, and maintain configurations and customizations of Finance Systems to meet the evolving needs of the finance team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal users and stakeholders, assisting with data analysis, business process mapping, reporting needs and continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain proper system access for user roles ensuring compliance with segregation of duties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide internal, ongoing system/technical support to Finance users, including training with a focus on superior customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor end user usage of business systems and track performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide front line support with regards to all aspects of business facing applications and troubleshooting to diagnose, isolate and resolve issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, document and implement policies, procedures and guidelines to ensure data integrity, system integrity and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the change management and release process of NetSuite, Zuora, Stripe, and other finance applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide quality and timely communication regarding system status&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain up-to-date knowledge of system functionality, customization and integration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding of additional business units and acquired subsidiaries onto Suite Billing, Zuora Billing and related quote-to-cash systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A successful candidate for this position will demonstrate the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to integrate AI tools to optimize/redesign workflows and drive measurable impact (e.g., efficiency gains, quality improvements)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing AI skill development (e.g., prompt/context engineering, Claude Plugin/Skills) and staying current with emerging AI technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Finance System administration, configuration, and third-party integrations in complex environments with a focus on NetSuite and Zuora&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with roles, permissions, page layouts, custom objects, SuiteScripts, workflows, reports, and dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL, CSV imports, user provisioning, role definitions, analytics, JavaScript(JS) and script scheduling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in data analytics, reporting, and database management (SQL and NetSuite preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with revenue recognition principles and financial reporting concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of business processes&amp;nbsp; (O2C &amp;amp; P2P), system requirements, and financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the hire-to-retire process and system access management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in project management, system implementation, and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently with minimal guidance while collaborating across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at managing multiple stakeholders and maintaining professionalism under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred but Not Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NetSuite and/or Zuora certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Disclosures:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to providing a positive interview experience for every candidate. If accommodations due to a disability or medical condition are needed, please connect with the talent partner via email.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carta uses E-Verify in the United States for employment authorization. See the &lt;a href="https://www.e-verify.gov/about-e-verify/what-is-e-verify"&gt;E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="Department"&gt;Department of Justice&lt;/a&gt; websites for more details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For information on our data privacy policies, see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class="c-link" href="https://carta.com/privacy/" target="_blank" data-stringify-link="https://carta.com/privacy/" data-sk="tooltip_parent"&gt;Privacy&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class="c-link" href="https://carta.com/privacy/candidate/" target="_blank" data-stringify-link="https://carta.com/privacy/candidate/" data-sk="tooltip_parent"&gt;CA Candidate Privacy&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a class="c-link" href="https://carta.com/legal/br/brazil-pay-transparency/" target="_blank" data-stringify-link="https://carta.com/legal/br/brazil-pay-transparency/" data-sk="tooltip_parent"&gt;Brazil Transparency Report&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that all official communications from us will come from an ----- or ----- domain. Report any contact from unapproved domains to -----
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:lead-cloud-engineer-497128:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at CreateFuture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://createfuture.com/"&gt;CreateFuture&lt;/a&gt; is an &lt;strong&gt;AI-native consulting partner &lt;/strong&gt;where people do work that matters and are supported to do it well. We work alongside organisations such as PayPal, adidas, NatWest, FanDuel and Money Saving Expert, building digital products and services that make a difference&amp;nbsp; while always putting people first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of creators. We write code, shape delivery, build go-to-market strategies, develop AI solutions and create the practices that support our people. We work side by side with our clients, challenging what’s not working and helping them to build the future. Our commitment to craft, quality, and culture has helped us scale to over 600 people in just a few years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our UK Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;35 days leave (including bank holidays).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental and adoption leave.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial coaching + 5% pension match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40 hours of paid learning and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-uZ_KOuW1SI-xoZ0Sd0WJCisULzkYox4/view?usp=sharing"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;View our full list of UK benefits.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;CreateFuture is a&lt;a href="https://www.greatplacetowork.co.uk/certified-company/1572759"&gt; Great Place to Work-Certified™ company&lt;/a&gt; and has won Best Workplaces UK multiple years in a row.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us on our journey. Let’s create tomorrow, together, today.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role and team:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CreateFuture, our Lead Engineer - Cloud plays a pivotal role in supporting the success of our Cloud engineers, our clients, and internal projects. Working closely with clients, you are responsible for the successful delivery of client and internal projects by building professional relationships with key client stakeholders, challenging where appropriate. Use your technical expertise to provide best practice advice and processes within your project team and the wider capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our client demands expand from traditional cloud migrations to AI enablement and platform engineering, you will lead the charge in building autonomous platforms, managing AI lifecycles, and enforcing strict cost governance across cloud estates. You are seen as a leader internally and externally, through your technical expertise, guidance, and professionalism, both on and off a client. Alongside delivering for your customers, you will also support and mentor a team of cloud engineers to encourage their growth. You will be setting the technical direction of the team alongside Cloud Leads and Senior Engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id="message-list_1789470082.722669"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An 8-week discovery will define the migration approach, common tooling, deployment standards and tribe-by-tribe responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The technical work includes converting existing YAML deployment configuration into AWS CDK-based infrastructure as code, building CI/CD pipelines, Dockerising applications, and deploying them with Kubernetes and Helm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery will vary by tribe: some teams may migrate independently using central standards and tools, while others may need more direct assistance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Createfuture is supplying a small central team initially—lead cloud engineer and principal software engineer—then adding two cloud engineers and a senior software engineer after discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultancy &amp;amp; Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply a growth mindset to identify new revenue opportunities on client accounts, working alongside the commercial team to successfully land additional work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Sales Contribution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and contribute to pre-sales activities, RFPs, and BIDs, accounting for up to 5% to 10% of the role. Engage with the commercial team to drive high-value Cloud and Data advisory roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ambassadorial Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an ambassador for CreateFuture in the public space, attending events, speaking, blogging, or leveraging social media to support the growth of the Cloud capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on:&lt;/strong&gt; you are an experienced engineer and can be active with the cloud platform tools, software development and writing efficient code for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Platform Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Take responsibility for the technical direction and delivery of single or multiple client and internal project teams, acting as either a technical lead or a solo contributor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Native Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect and implement the core engineering infrastructure required to run AI workloads reliably, moving client architectures from static data lakes to dynamic Vector Databases and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Build production-grade Agentic Workflows and custom AI agents, utilising advanced toolsets to bridge the widening market implementation gap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Setting Development Best Practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Define, promote, and establish best practice tools, security approaches, and common service patterns across the entire CreateFuture organisation. Ensure Infrastructure as Code (IaC) is the organisational default and challenge inefficient legacy processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FinOps &amp;amp; Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Enforce strict automated security and cost controls, real-time cost-anomaly detection, and cost estimation into the Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC) as a standard. Understanding of OpenTelemetry or other telemetry approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Platform Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist the Capability Lead and architects in defining and delivering an internal collection of reusable components, reference architectures, and Proof of Concepts (PoCs). Supporting the internal IT function in helping other parts of the business use Cloud services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leading &amp;amp; Mentoring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead by example, creating a culture of open, honest feedback, collaboration, ownership, and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Create a psychologically safe environment for the team that enables them to grow by supporting their development journeys and career aspirations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capability Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Work alongside the Capability Lead and Director of Cloud and Data to identify missing or inconsistent skills within the department, supporting team members through tiered certification journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Talent Acquisition through the recruitment process, including conducting interviews, candidate debriefs, and strategic decision-making to attract top talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Technical Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates must demonstrate a hybrid skillset, balancing Software Engineering (30%), Platform/SRE (40%), and Data Engineering (30%), with a core focus on Security, Governance, and Cost Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Infrastructure (40%):&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced Infrastructure as Code (IaC) via Terraform, advanced Kubernetes administration (clusters, nodes, pods), hardcore networking (VPC peering, Service Mesh, Zero Trust security), and solution architecture experience, with a cost-optimisation mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering, Agentic &amp;amp; AI Development (30%):&lt;/strong&gt; Solid software engineer principles (pipelines, toolsets, testing, linting, vulnerability scanning, etc.) Production-level experience with tools such as Amazon Bedrock, AWS AgentCore, Azure AI Studio, LangChain, and writing automation scripts or custom AI agents using node or python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Engineering (30%):&lt;/strong&gt; Experience deploying and maintaining data orchestration toolsets (e.g., dbt, Apache Airflow), ETL/ELT methodologies, real-time streaming (e.g., AWS Kinesis, Apache Kafka), Vector databases, and RAG architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observability &amp;amp; FinOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience implementing modern observability tooling (OpenTelemetry) alongside automated cost-control systems (such as Karpenter, Infracost, OpenCost, or Cloud Custodian).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Sector Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulated Industries:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working in highly regulated sectors such as Financial Services or iGaming is helpful, demonstrating an understanding of strict compliance, data privacy risks, and governance guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven background in a client-facing consulting capacity, managing stakeholders, handling commercial realities, and meeting strict SLAs, timescales, and budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Knowledge-level &amp;amp; Certifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multiple professional-level certifications (AWS Certified Solutions Architect - Professional or Azure Architect AZ-305.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beneficial for AWS GenAI Developer Professional, AWS ML Engineer Associate, or Azure AI Engineer Associate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FinOps Certified Practitioner (FOCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h3 id="What-we’ll-offer-you:" data-renderer-start-pos="8044"&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust you to manage your time balancing collaboration with client time and focused work. What matters is the impact you have, not how busy you look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We try to keep our hiring process clear, fair and respectful of your time. We aim to get back to everyone who applies and we will be upfront about where you are in the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It usually looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with our Talent Acquisition Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role specific capability interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, we might also ask you to do a short presentation, a practical or technical task or have a values focused conversation. We will explain what is involved before anything happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at CreateFuture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe diverse teams build better workplaces and better products. We want CreateFuture to be a place where people feel able to be themselves and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any adjustments or support during the application process, just. We will do what we can to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:remote-senior-customer-support:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About Vercel:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Vercel is the agentic infrastructure company, freeing people and agents to ship what's next. For more than a decade we've helped builders move from idea to production with speed, security, and exceptional developer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Now we're scaling our products for both agents and people to ship and run software, built in the open and trusted by OpenAI, PayPal, Ramp, Supreme, and millions of developers worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reporting to the Manager, Customer Support Engineering, you’ll resolve customer concerns, create and improve internal tooling, and engineer solutions that help Vercel customers get the most out of the platform. We’re seeking a deeply technical engineer with relevant support experience who can specialize in multiple core domains while partnering across teams to drive great outcomes.&lt;br&gt;You’re an excellent communicator who earns customer trust, understands complex systems quickly, and enjoys digging deep to find and resolve root causes. You’re comfortable participating in an occasional weekend or holiday on-call rotation (scheduled in advance) as part of our global coverage model.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you’re based within a pre-determined commuting distance of one of our offices (SF, NY, London, or Berlin), the role includes in-office anchor days on Monday, Tuesday, and Friday. If you’re located beyond that distance, the role is fully remote.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For location-specific details, please connect with our recruiting team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve interesting, technically complex cases for Vercel customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot issues alongside Engineering; identify and drive fixes and mitigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Solutions, and Customer Success to provide guidance internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and improve internal tools and scripts that increase team efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specialize in a given product area (&lt;strong&gt;v0&lt;/strong&gt;) and act as a domain owner within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve existing documentation and create new runbooks, guides, and internal processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist Customer Success Managers with Enterprise requests and escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You lead by example and provide feedback to mentor other members of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;hands-on experience using Vercel and v0&lt;/strong&gt; as a platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;modern development and architecture experience&lt;/strong&gt; in the &lt;strong&gt;AI&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;web&lt;/strong&gt; space (e.g., building LLM-powered apps, web services, or production web applications) and can explain these concepts to others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have prior &lt;strong&gt;customer support experience&lt;/strong&gt; in a technical role: troubleshooting customer cases, writing clear solutions, and proactively problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy engineering solutions to resolve root causes of recurring problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong written and verbal communication; able to explain complex systems clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable working with a fully remote, globally distributed team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a passion for delivering a customer experience second to none.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are willing to participate in a weekend/holiday on-call rotation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus If You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have frontend development experience (e.g., React/Next.js).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy technical writing for public docs or developer education.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience automating workflows with agentic services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent="0" data-stringify-border="0"&gt;Competitive compensation package, including equity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent="0" data-stringify-border="0"&gt;Inclusive Healthcare Package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent="0" data-stringify-border="0"&gt;Learn and Grow - we provide mentorship and send you to events that help you build your network and skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent="0" data-stringify-border="0"&gt;Flexible Time Off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent="0" data-stringify-border="0"&gt;We will provide you the gear you need to do your role, and a WFH budget for you to outfit your space as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id="te-floating-button-container"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclosures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://vercel.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice"&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; for more information on how we handle your data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Vercel is committed to fostering and empowering an inclusive community within our organization. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, gender expression or identity, sexual orientation, national origin, citizenship, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status, or any other characteristic protected by law. Vercel encourages everyone to apply for our available positions, even if they don't necessarily check every box on the job description.&lt;/li&gt;
