arbeitnow:staff-product-engineer-463328:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Parloa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa’s mission is to make every customer conversation feel effortless for both customers and the companies serving them. As agentic AI accelerates, Parloans are shaping the foundation of a new era in customer experience, one where customer support is no longer transactions, but meaningful exchanges. It is not just a vision; Parloa has powered over ONE BILLION interactions between global enterprise brands and their customers, with companies like &lt;a href="http://booking.com"&gt;Booking.com&lt;/a&gt;, HealthEquity, Allianz, SAP, BarmeniaGothaer, and TUI already deploying Parloa at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Product Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will work directly inside our most strategic enterprise customers. You will build the software that makes their AI agents work in production, and be measured by the difference it makes for the customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our agents are built by business users in Parloa’s platform, AMP. AMP already comes with a broad library of tools and integrations. Your job is the part AMP does not cover yet for a given customer: the last connection into their systems, or a capability the product does not have. Our customers are large enterprises in financial services, telecom, insurance, travel and retail. For them, a working prototype is where an engagement starts, not where it ends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The work comes in two forms. Some engagements run for years. You stay with the account, deepen its integrations and help it grow into new use cases. Others are short experiments. You test a new idea with a real customer and decide quickly whether it is worth building. At Staff level, you take on the hardest cases of both: accounts where a pilot-grade solution would fail in production, and capabilities nobody at Parloa has built before. Staff means harder problems and more ambiguity, not less hands-on work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On many accounts, you work alongside a Deployment Strategist. Think of the two of you as the account’s leadership team. The Deployment Strategist acts as its CPO and defines what success looks like. You act as its CTO and own the architecture and the build. On accounts without a Deployment Strategist, you own the engineering yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Areas of ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the hardest engagements.&lt;/strong&gt; Run complex programmes with several workstreams. Make the architecture decisions that span Parloa’s platform and several parts of the customer’s organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build what AMP does not cover yet.&lt;/strong&gt; Systems of record, telephony and contact-center integrations, state management, data readiness, multi-agent orchestration and retrieval. When the answer is unclear, build a prototype quickly and decide whether it is worth pursuing before Parloa invests a full quarter in it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own production quality and security.&lt;/strong&gt; Evals, production readiness, observability and incident playbooks for enterprise-scale traffic. Meet the data handling standards a regulated customer expects, including PII, access control and audit trails. Debug live issues, whether they are technical or caused by model behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow the account, and share what belongs in the product.&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the second use case, the second business unit, the renewal. Set the delivery standard for other engineers on complex accounts. When something you build would help every customer, flag it. That is how Parloa decides what goes into the core product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor other Product Engineers&lt;/strong&gt;, and take part in interviewing and hiring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use AI well, and set the standard for it.&lt;/strong&gt; Decide how AI-assisted work is validated before it reaches a customer’s production traffic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent Parloa with senior technical stakeholders.&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with the customer’s principal engineers, architects and security leaders. Be the engineer commercial teams bring in when a prospect asks how the solution would work for them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What this role is not:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not running the Parloa platform itself.&lt;/strong&gt; That is a separate engineering role. The platform is your foundation, and you build what a specific customer needs on top of it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not agent configuration.&lt;/strong&gt; Business users design and configure agents in AMP. You build the integrations and capabilities those agents need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not a people-management role.&lt;/strong&gt; You are an individual contributor and write and review code every week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR TECH STACK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Go, TypeScript, Node.js, Python, FastAPI, frontier LLMs, MCP, Azure, Kubernetes, Docker, Terraform, MongoDB, Redis, Kafka/NATS&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will not use all of these, and most engagements add something new.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years of professional software development&lt;/strong&gt;, delivering production systems end to end. Fluent in TypeScript or Python, or able to get there quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years leading the design and architecture of large-scale production systems&lt;/strong&gt; in customer-facing or enterprise environments, with a focus on reliability, scale and failure modes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience leading agentic, spec-driven development in production.&lt;/strong&gt; You know when a coding agent’s output is wrong and what checks it needs before it ships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A track record in long-term accounts or fast experiments.&lt;/strong&gt; You have owned a strategic enterprise relationship over several years, through an expansion, a renewal or a leadership change. Or you have tested new ideas at the frontier and decided quickly whether they were worth building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience as a mentor or tech lead&lt;/strong&gt;, helping engineers become independent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and with customers.&lt;/strong&gt; You work well in complex organizations, build trust quickly with new customer teams, spot risks early and keep your judgment when the stakes are high.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Willingness to travel up to 25%&lt;/strong&gt; to customer sites, depending on the engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong spoken and written communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or deploying an LLM-powered system used by real users in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with eval frameworks, agent tooling, RAG, prompt engineering or multi-agent orchestration (few candidates will have all of these)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A founder or founding-engineer background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forward-deployed, solutions engineering, product engineering or strategic-partner experience at an enterprise software or AI company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voice or conversational AI, or contact center, telephony or CCaaS integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in regulated industries such as banking, insurance or telecom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our engineering values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Parloa, we hire, promote, and evaluate based on cultural and technical excellence. You’ll thrive here if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Earn Trust&lt;/strong&gt; – act with transparency and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Obsess Over Customers&lt;/strong&gt; – always start with the customer problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think Big&lt;/strong&gt; – set bold goals and pursue them fearlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have Integrity&lt;/strong&gt; – do the right thing, especially when it’s hard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disagree &amp;amp; Commit&lt;/strong&gt; – debate with candor, align fast, and deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own It&lt;/strong&gt; – take full responsibility for outcomes, not just tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dive Deep&lt;/strong&gt; – master the details without losing sight of the big picture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias for Action&lt;/strong&gt; – move fast, decide quickly, iterate fearlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Value&lt;/strong&gt; – measure success by customer and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insist on the Highest Standards&lt;/strong&gt; – raise the bar continuously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go the Extra Mile&lt;/strong&gt; – make the impossible possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hire &amp;amp; Elevate the Best&lt;/strong&gt; – raise the bar with every hire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our recruiting process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recruiter Call → Technical Peer Interview → 360° Tech Interview Loop → Bar Raiser&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Parloa?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re at the beginning of a new era in customer experience, one where AI doesn’t just respond, but understands, reasons, and takes action. We’re building agentic AI that enterprises trust with their most important customer moments: complex questions, high volumes, real stakes. When millions of people reach out to a brand, those interactions aren’t just support tickets; they’re defining experiences. We’re here to raise the standard: making every conversation seamless, intelligent, and genuinely helpful. If you care about shaping how businesses and customers connect at scale—and want your work to matter in real, everyday moments—this is where you do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Parloa, ownership isn’t a buzzword; it means being accountable for outcomes, not just tasks. We operate in a category that’s evolving fast, where the bar is high, and the problems are complex. We hire people who think in solutions, communicate with clarity, and follow through. People who are comfortable making decisions, taking responsibility, and raising the standard for themselves and those around them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve grown beyond the earliest startup phase, but we’ve kept the intensity: fast execution, direct feedback, and a strong expectation to contribute meaningfully from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by leading global investors like General Catalyst, EQT Ventures, and Altimeter Capital, we’re scaling with a clear ambition: to become the global category leader in enterprise-grade conversational AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe style="display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/P4d-iyx7RQM" width="560" height="314"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa is committed to upholding the highest data protection standards for our clients' and employees' data. All our employees are instrumental in ensuring the utmost care, GDPR, and ISO compliance, including ISO 27001, in handling sensitive information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa is an e-verify employer in the USA. &lt;a class="c-link" href="https://www.e-verify.gov/about-e-verify/what-is-e-verify" target="_blank" data-stringify-link="https://www.e-verify.gov/about-e-verify/what-is-e-verify" data-sk="tooltip_parent"&gt;Please click here to learn more&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;* &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We provide equal opportunities to all qualified applicants regardless race, gender, sexual orientation, age, religion, national origin, disability status, socioeconomic background and other characteristics.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:strategic-account-executive-ma:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI's operational blind spots into operational clarity. World's leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there's a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join a high-performing sales team within the DACH sales organization, responsible for driving growth within large global enterprises from the Manufacturing industry. Manufacturing is one of our strategic industries, where we help global leaders optimize their end-to-end processes, increase operational efficiency through our Process Intelligence platform, and provide the contextual layer to industrialize Enterprise AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applying a value-driven consultative sales approach, you will create and cultivate strategic relationships to drive sales cycles from deep discovery to value realization. You will be responsible for a selected portfolio of strategic accounts from the Manufacturing industry headquartered in Switzerland, generating new business opportunities with existing customers. Navigating complex organizations up to the C-suite, you will collaborate cross-functionally to understand your accounts' needs and systematically drive the end-to-end sales cycle to a successful close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Work you'll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will primarily work and manage existing customers, land-and-expand is the typical model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage cross line-of-business at C-level and below&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Celonis Process Intelligence &amp;amp; Enterprise AI sales motions &lt;strong&gt;across the entire core enterprise value chain,&lt;/strong&gt; translating core challenges into &lt;strong&gt;compelling, AI-enabled use cases&lt;/strong&gt; that deliver &lt;strong&gt;measurable execution capacity&lt;/strong&gt; against &lt;strong&gt;strategic customer pain points.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold an individual revenue target for closing seven-figure deals within your accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage closely with partners e.g, consulting firms and SaaS vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive complex sales cycles through orchestrating virtual teams including business development representatives, marketing managers, partner managers, sales engineers / pre-sales, customer success managers, professional services, implementation partners...&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years of relevant experience&lt;/strong&gt; in either one - or ideally both - of the following domains:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style="padding-left: 40px;"&gt;○ &lt;strong&gt;SaaS Sales:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of applying a consultative sales approach to sell complex, strategic business solutions to large enterprise accounts with full account ownership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="padding-left: 40px;"&gt;○ &lt;strong&gt;AI / Management Consulting:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in a (boutique) consultancy, driving AI projects with direct responsibility for account management, client relationships, business development / client acquisition and carrying your own net new revenue quota&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of commitment, long tenure, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;successful career progression&lt;/strong&gt; with your previous companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;business acumen&lt;/strong&gt; and a deep understanding of &lt;strong&gt;core processes&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;KPIs&lt;/strong&gt; throughout the entire enterprise value chain in the Manufacturing industry, particularly within the domains of Production, Supply Chain, and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Manufacturing industry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build trusted relationships with senior Business and IT stakeholders and engage effectively at the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;C-level&lt;/strong&gt; (CFO, COO, CIO, VP Operations, Manufacturing Director, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit&lt;/strong&gt;, a &lt;strong&gt;hands-on mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;strong discovery&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;sales process leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in German&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, with exceptional communication and presentation skills to engage and excite stakeholders effectively at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt to a fast moving, ever changing, high growth environment and approach challenges with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;positivity, creative thinking, &lt;/strong&gt;and a&lt;strong&gt; growth mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to be collaborative, inclusive, to embrace diversity and to have strong interpersonal skills #differentmakesusbetter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to leverage internal resources and work as a team #bestteamwins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p lang="de" style="margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zurich area location preferred&lt;/strong&gt;; candidates based elsewhere in Switzerland must be available for &lt;strong data-path-to-node="6,0" data-index-in-node="97"&gt;weekly in-person presence&lt;/strong&gt; and customer visits (primarily in &lt;strong&gt;German-speaking Switzerland&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(236, 240, 241);"&gt;#LI-SS6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class="p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested" data-stringify-type="unordered-list" data-list-tree="true" data-indent="0" data-border="0"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time "Celonaut" is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated "Wellness Weeks" that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="1264"&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="1982"&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class="_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe" data-renderer-mark="true" data-is-router-link="false" data-testid="link-with-safety"&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that's when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href="https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices"&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href="https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/"&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href="https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:principal-design-engineer-6253:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;The world’s most sophisticated companies rely on AlphaSense to remove uncertainty from decision-making. With market intelligence and search built on proven AI, AlphaSense delivers insights that matter from content you can trust. Our universe of public and private content includes equity research, company filings, event transcripts, expert calls, news, trade journals, and clients’ own research content. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;The acquisition of Tegus by AlphaSense in 2024 advances our shared mission to empower professionals to make smarter decisions through AI-driven market intelligence. Together, AlphaSense and Tegus will accelerate growth, innovation, and content expansion, with complementary product and content capabilities that enable users to unearth even more comprehensive insights from thousands of content sets. Our platform is trusted by over 6,000 enterprise customers, including a majority of the S&amp;amp;P 500. Founded in 2011, AlphaSense is headquartered in New York City with more than 2,000 employees across the globe and offices in the U.S., U.K., Finland, India, Singapore, Canada, and Ireland. Come join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify;"&gt;AlphaSense’s Design team is a strategic driver of product differentiation, shaping how the world’s leading companies make high-stakes decisions with confidence. We believe great UX is not just about usability, it’s about deeply understanding our customers’ workflows and building experiences that feel tailored, intelligent, and indispensable to how they work.&lt;br&gt;As AlphaSense evolves into an AI-native platform, Design plays a critical role in defining how AI shows up in real workflows, from search to synthesis to decision-making. We partner closely with Product and Engineering to turn complex data and advanced AI capabilities into cohesive, intuitive, and high-quality experiences.&lt;br&gt;Our team is a global group of craftspeople, systems thinkers, and innovators who care deeply about quality, velocity, and impact. We operate with a strong sense of ownership, a bias toward action, and a commitment to raising the bar for what great product design looks like in an AI-first world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are seeking a Principal Design Engineer to play a key role in shaping the future of AlphaSense’s product experience. This is a senior individual contributor role, where you’ll lead through craft, systems thinking, and technical excellence, building AI-powered experiences that feel tailored, intelligent, and essential to our customers’ workflows.&lt;br&gt;You will operate at the intersection of design, engineering, and product strategy, translating complex, data-rich problems into high-quality, production-ready experiences. You won’t just prototype ideas; you’ll define how they are built, scaled, and experienced in the product.&lt;br&gt;As a senior member of the Design team, you’ll act as a multiplier—mentoring others, guiding technical and design decisions, and strengthening the connection between user needs, business goals, and engineering realities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At AlphaSense, design is a core driver of how we win. As we build an AI-native platform, the quality of our user experience will define how effectively customers can navigate complexity, build conviction, and make decisions.&lt;br&gt;In this role, you will help define that standard—through the systems you build, the experiences you ship, and the team you help elevate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create high-fidelity, coded prototypes and interaction models that bring complex, AI-powered workflows to life and clearly communicate product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own high-impact initiatives from concept through production, shipping experiences that reflect strong design thinking, technical rigor, and a deep understanding of customer workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical design discussions, make architectural decisions, and guide cross-team implementation efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advance AlphaSense’s design system as a core piece of product infrastructure—defining scalable patterns, enabling consistency, and accelerating teams building across AI-native experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product managers, engineers, and other stakeholders to research and evaluate user requirements, translate them into effective designs, and ensure that the final product meets both user and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering teams during development, advocating for design quality and user experience by championing design fidelity and attention to detail throughout the development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Leadership &amp;amp; Team Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior leader within the Design team, mentoring designers and engineers, raising the bar for craft, and contributing to a strong, collaborative design culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as connective tissue across design, product, and engineering—helping teams navigate tradeoffs between technical constraints, business goals, and user experience to deliver high-quality outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in product design, design/UX/front-end engineering, design systems, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s degree or higher. A degree in design, computer science, information sciences, psychology, or human-computer interaction is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with modern front-end technologies (e.g., HTML/CSS, JavaScript/TypeScript, React) and evolving design systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building AI and agentic experiences, and you are already leveraging AI to speed up and augment your end-to-end design and development process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with modern AI technologies and ability to apply them to design problems (e.g., MCP, Claude Code, Codex, Skills).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping production-ready experiences and influencing technical and design choices across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of user-centered design principles, end-to-end customer workflows, and the ability to turn new users into habitual users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in project leadership, mentorship, and providing constructive feedback to foster professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href="http://alpha-sense.com/" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo"&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl"&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-support-engineer-digita:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre équipe Seconde Vie United recherche un·e Senior Support Engineer basé·e à Lille.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯 Ta Mission&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que &lt;strong&gt;Senior Support Engineer / Lead Support&lt;/strong&gt;, tu es le garant de la continuité, de la stabilité et de la qualité de service d'un groupe d'applications critiques pour la Seconde Vie. En collaboration étroite avec les Feature Teams, les Product Managers, les helpdesks (L1/L2) et les parties prenantes métiers, tu pilotes l'activité de support et fais évoluer nos pratiques.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;💫 &lt;strong&gt;Tes Responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestion des supports request (Ticketing) &lt;/strong&gt;: Assurer le support de niveau 3 sur un périmètre applicatif varié (collaborateurs magasins/entrepôts, conseillers clients, relais pays) et garantir le respect de nos SLA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead du Process d’Incident Management&lt;/strong&gt; : Fort de ton expérience, tu prends le lead sur l'animation et le suivi des incidents pour le périmètre.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestion des connaissances (Knowledge Management)&lt;/strong&gt; : Rédiger, structurer et enrichir notre base de connaissances (Runbooks) afin d'autonomiser les niveaux L1/L2 et d'améliorer le MTTR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyse des rootcauses des problèmes&lt;/strong&gt; : Détecter les causes profondes des dysfonctionnements (bugs, optimisations, besoin de formation) pour réduire durablement les tickets récurrents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Debrief réguliers&lt;/strong&gt; avec les product managers et communication sur l’état de santé des produits, sur les problèmes récurrents, et sur l'efficacité opérationnelle (respect des SLA &amp;amp; MTTR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Astreinte&lt;/strong&gt; : Participer aux rotations d'astreinte pour nos fonctions critiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenger les feature teams&lt;/strong&gt; sur les fonctionnalités et transformations à venir (valider les conceptions de solution, les documentations et la validation de la mise en production) pour garantir le maintien d'un système stable pour nos utilisateurs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adapter notre schéma et nos pratiques de support&lt;/strong&gt; aux défis à venir&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🛠️&amp;nbsp; STACK TECHNIQUE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL niveau autonome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Postman, Bruno ou équivalent niveau autonome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse de logs applicatifs niveau autonome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gestion de ticketing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compétences en observabilité (Datadog)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expériences avec plusieurs de nos différentes technologies (PHP, Java, kafka, rabbitmq) est un plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise des bonnes pratiques ITIL (Incident, Problem &amp;amp; Change Management)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤 CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience&lt;/strong&gt; : de 5 ans et + en support IT / Ingénierie applicative (niveau IC2/IC3)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posture Lead&lt;/strong&gt; : Capacité à animer une équipe, gérer des prestataires et vulgariser auprès de profils variés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt; : Aisance relationnelle et anglais courant pour échanger avec nos équipes en France et à l'international&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt; : Culture de l'amélioration continue, orientation utilisateur et appétence technique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passion&lt;/strong&gt; : Passionné·e de sport et désireux·se de partager cette passion au quotidien !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎁 CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisation de travail hybride ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac ou Windows) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d'un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package de rémunération (actionnariat salarié, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTRE ENGAGEMENT EN FAVEUR DE L'INCLUSION ET DE L'ACCESSIBILITE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l'immense valeur qu'apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c'est pourquoi l'Inclusion est l'un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon s'engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d'aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n'affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement"&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d'offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C'est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l'environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

